# zip_open with consistency checking must reject an entry whose comment contains
# a NUL byte. Here the header comment is "A", but an Info-ZIP Unicode Comment
# extra field (0x6375) with a matching CRC replaces it with the bytes 00 C3 A9
# (U+0000 U+00E9), so the NUL only appears in the final comment. The check must
# run after the extra field is applied.
program tryopen
arguments -c -s test.zzip
file test.zzip incons-utf8-nul-in-comment.zip
return 1
stdout
opening 'test.zzip' returned error Zip archive inconsistent: entry 0: NUL byte in file comment
end-of-inline-data
stderr
1 errors
end-of-inline-data
